  "description": "The meme references the concept of 'economic collapse,' a real-world scenario where an economy experiences severe downturns, leading to widespread unemployment, inflation, and resource scarcity. The meme uses this concept to frame a hypothetical scenario where societal norms and survival strategies are tested, implying that women's responses will be judged by a false dichotomy of preparedness versus transactional behavior.",
